  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_2": "首先，向湯鍋內添加湯底",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_3": "接下來，添加烹飪所需的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_4": "確保食譜無誤後，蓋上湯鍋蓋",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_5": "接下來只需等待片刻……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_6": "……然後揭開鍋蓋",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.stockpot.text_7": "烹飪就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.header": "使用炒鍋",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_1": "想要使用炒鍋烹飪，需要將炒鍋置於有效熱源之上",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_2": "首先，起鍋燒油！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_3": "接下來，添加烹飪所需的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_4": "確保食譜無誤後，開始翻炒！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_5": "接下來只需等待片刻……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.pot.text_6": "……料理就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.header": "放置蒸籠",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_1": "想要使用蒸籠烹飪，需要將蒸籠置於有效熱源之上",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_2": "對著蒸籠頂部放置蒸籠，可以向上堆疊……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_3": "……一直向上堆疊",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_4": "然而，一個熱源只能為8個蒸籠提供熱量……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer.text_5": "……所以，請注意堆疊的數量",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.header": "使用蒸籠",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_1": "從蒸籠頂部放入待蒸的食材",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_2": "也可直接堆疊裝有食材的蒸籠",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_3": "放置完畢後，給蒸籠封頂以開始烹飪",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_4": "接下來只需等待一段時間……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_5": "待到烹飪完成，便可揭下蒸籠頂蓋……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.steamer_1.text_6": "……最後一層層取下蒸籠與成品",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.header": "使用搪瓷盆子",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_1": "打開搪瓷盆蓋以存入油脂",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_2": "使用鍋鏟可以從搪瓷盆子中取出 1 份油脂……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.enamel_basin.text_3": "……你就能用沾有油脂的鍋鏟來給炒鍋添油了",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.header": "使用石磨",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_1": "手持待加工的物體右鍵磨盤可以將其放入石磨",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_2": "磨盤上方的掉落物也會被自動置入石磨中",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_3": "石磨會自動綁定周圍的生物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_4": "綁定了生物後，石磨開始工作……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.millstone.text_5": "……走過一圈後，材料轉化為成品，從開口噴出",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.header": "使用旋風烤肉塔",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_1": "首先將食材放入旋風烤肉塔的上下兩層",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_2": "每層最多能夠放入 8 個相同的可燒煉食物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_3": "通入紅石信號以激活烤肉塔，開始烹飪",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_4": "接下來只需等待一段時間……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_5": "……烹飪就完成啦！",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_6": "然而，直接從激活的旋風烤肉塔上空手取下食物會被燒傷",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_7": "正確的做法是使用菜刀取下食物……",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.shawarma_spit.text_8": "……或是先關閉激活烤肉塔的紅石信號再嘗試取下食物",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.header": "使用菜譜",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.text_1": "手持空白的菜譜右鍵已有物品放入的炒鍋或湯鍋，會將當前已加入的材料和烹飪結果記錄到菜譜中",
  "kaleidoscope_cookery.ponder.recipe_item.text_2": "手持已記錄食物配方的菜譜右鍵炒鍋或湯鍋，會將背包中攜帶有的記錄在菜譜中的材料自動加入鍋中",
